  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSR Facility 2015: DanWatch. Retten til mad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &apos;The right to food&apos; targets the supply chains of global food production The strategic objective of the project is to improve working conditions, human rights and the environment in low-income countries. Danwatch aims to communicate knowledge about challenges in the global food production. Investigative journalism will contribute to a qualified public debate regarding companies&apos; and investors&apos; business conduct and responsibility throughout the value chain and thus engage the industry and investors in responsible production and on-going dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
